  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "எனதென தென்றிருக்கும் ஏழை பொருளை\nஎனதென தென்றிருப்பன் யானும் - தனதாயின்\nதானும் அதனை வழங்கான் பயன்துவ்வான்\nயானும் அதனை அது.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Whose is the miser's wealth? As to the property which the wretched churl claims saying 'It is mine, it is mine ,' I too chime in with \"It is mine, it is mine;' for if it is his, he himself spends it not, nor enjoys the benefit of it; and I, too, neither spend nor enjoy it!",
